    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d87">

                <pb facs="0353" n="67" sameAs="frus:frus1916Supp/pg67"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 124.683/5</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Greece</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Droppers</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Athens</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-11-23T08:00:00+02:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 23, 1916, 8 a. m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received 9.30 a. m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>186. Austro-Hungarian Minister, Bulgarian, and Turkish left today. Have assumed
                    charge their national interests in Greece. Referring to my telegram 185,<anchor
                        n="2" xml:id="d87-f1"/> after examination work accountant probably not
                    needed, but capable stenographer-typewriter urgently requested.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Droppers</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
